    "searchCoverage": "Official RiteKit REST API is GET https://api.ritekit.com/{path} with client_id query authentication (OAuth 2.0 is documented as unused by nearly all consumers and is not supported as a native oauth block here). GET /v1/search/trending is the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck. GET /v1/stats/multiple-hashtags and GET /v1/stats/hashtag-suggestions are documented reads. Operator is Maintop Businesses s.r.o. in Strážnice, Czech Republic. Native bodyErrorPaths cannot invert result:false; error and error_description are demoted when present. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying RiteKit platform compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
